<h2 style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: #2a2050; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;">Welcome to Patchwork Labs, <%= @user.first_name %>! 🧵</h2>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: #2a2050;">Your email is confirmed and your account is all set. You're now part of the Patchwork Labs community — a quilt of makers stitched together from around the world.</p>

<p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #2a2050; font-weight: 700;">What happens next</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin: 0 0 20px 0; width: 100%;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 0 0 12px 0; color: #2a2050; vertical-align: top; width: 24px;">1.</td>
    <td style="padding: 0 0 12px 0; color: #2a2050;">We've sent you a <strong>Slack invite</strong> in a separate email — accept it to join the community workspace.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 0 0 12px 0; color: #2a2050; vertical-align: top;">2.</td>
    <td style="padding: 0 0 12px 0; color: #2a2050;">Once you're in, our bot will DM you our <strong>Code of Conduct</strong>. Give it a read and hit <em>“I accept”</em>.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 0; color: #2a2050; vertical-align: top;">3.</td>
    <td style="padding: 0; color: #2a2050;">That's it — you'll be promoted to a full member and get access to the rest of the community.</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: #2a2050;">You can view your account any time here:</p>

<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin: 8px 0 24px 0;">
  <tr>
    <td style="border-radius: 8px; background-color: #6c3ec1;">
      <a href="<%= profile_url %>" style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 28px; background-color: #6c3ec1; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Geist', -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">
        View your account
      </a>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<div style="margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #ebe3f9; color: #5d5584; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;">
  <p style="margin: 0;">Glad you're here. If you have any questions, just reply to this email.</p>
</div>
